# LikeC4 tooling deps
/node_modules

# The root .gitignore ignores `dist/` at any depth (a Python-build pattern).
# We commit only the small, load-bearing semantic export:
#   - dist/model.json   the JSON model (agents + interactive docs site input)
# The heavy, fully-regenerable outputs (the static site under dist/static/ and
# the ~2.5 MB self-contained web-component bundle dist/likec4-views.js) are built
# on demand via `just arch-build` / `just arch-model` when the docs-site embed is
# actually wired up — no need to carry them in git meanwhile.
!dist/
dist/*
!dist/model.json
